{"message":"I can’t identify the source of the 1,716 points from the transaction history available to me. That history shows rewards earned per purchase, but it does not include a separate rewards-ledger entry identifying bonuses, adjustments, redemptions, reversals, or prior-period carryovers. I therefore can’t responsibly classify those points as a bonus or adjustment.

Please request a “Gold Rewards Card rewards discrepancy review” for the 1,716-point difference. Ask the reviewer to reconcile the current 7,021-point balance against the transaction-level rewards and identify the source and posting date of the additional points. They should also check for any bonus, adjustment, redemption reversal, return-related change, or prior-period balance activity and determine whether a correction is needed.

The bank’s rewards-review process uses the transaction date, merchant, purchase amount, and received-versus-expected reward amount when a specific purchase is involved. Since this is an account-level difference, provide the statement period or date range showing the 7,021-point balance and specifically reference the 1,716 points not accounted for in the listed transactions. You can request this review through Rho-Bank support, the mobile app chat, or 1-800-RHO-BANK."}
